;\">풀암</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><br></span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo2/uscepters/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">셉터</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> | </span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo2/uspears/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스피어</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> | </span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo2/ustaves/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스태프</span></b></font><b><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> </span></font></b></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">| </span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo2/uswords/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스워드</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> | </span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo2/uthrowing/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">던지는 \n                무기</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> |</span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo2/uwands/\"><b><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> </span></font></b><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">완드</span></b></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><b><font color=\"#996600\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Elite \nUniques</span></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> </span></font></b><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">: </span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo2/euweapons/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">무기</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> | </span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo2/euarmor/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">아머</span></b></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#999933\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellpadding=\"7\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"580\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" height=\"30\" width=\"562\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20021120025128/http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/Diablo2/sets7.shtml#sandersfolly\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Unique Rings </span></b></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">[반지]</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"86\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img data-original-src=\"http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/Diablo2/images/item/unique/ring1.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"33\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:32/33\" width=\"32\">\n</span></font></p><center>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"#908858\"><b>Nagelring</b></font></span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"white\" face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Ring</span></font><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><br></span></font></p></center></td>\n<td width=\"213\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Required Level: 7<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Magic Damage Reduced By 3</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+50-75 To \nAttack Rating</font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Attacker Takes Damage of \n3</font>*<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">15-30% Better Chance Of Getting Magic \nItem</font>(varies)<br>(Only Spawns In Patch 1.09 or later) </span></font> </p></td>\n<td width=\"231\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">레벨 \n                            요구치 : 7<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">매직데미지 감소 3</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+50-75 공격등급 </font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">공격자가 받는 데미지 3</font>*<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">15-30% 매직아이템 얻을 확률증가</font>(varies)<br>(1.09 패치이후부터 \n                            얻을 수 있음)</span></font> </p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"86\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img data-original-src=\"http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/Diablo2/images/item/unique/ring2.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"33\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:32/33\" width=\"32\">\n</span></font></p><center>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"#908858\"><b>Manald \nHeal</b></font></span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bott